{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40719","headline":"送友罢举赴边职 · 李洞","name":"送友罢举赴边职","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出剡篇章入洛文，无人细读叹俱焚。\n莫辞秉笏随红斾，便好携家住白云。\n过水象浮蛮境见，隔江猿呌汉州闻。\n高谈阔略陈从事，盟誓边庭壮我军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}